WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.590
Orbit Base... all engines down!

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.750
All communications networks are down!

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.730
The life-support system has reached its limit now.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.050
Hard to believe that all circuits have been insulated...

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.960
What in the world is that thing?

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:20.400
Agent Utsugi's X-ray scan showed no abnormalities whatsoever.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.960
3 years ago, EI-01 appeared on Earth and...

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:29.000
...implanted the seed of an entirely new strain of Zonder inside Ms. Utsugi's body.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:34.980
A foreign substance.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.680
And this seed assumed the functions of her nervous system...

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.350
...waiting for the day when it would mature into a life-form impervious...

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.990
...even to the power of the G-Stone!

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.620
It's a New Machine Species!

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.500
An entity even more advanced than the 31 Machine Primevals...

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:52.190
And with a purpose far more terrible than mechanization.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.570
Substance sublimation!

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.730
The gravity generator has been shut down!

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.310
All GGG members, you must...

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:09.680
No!

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.280
That thing...

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.680
That thing...

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.780
Everybody's gonna be killed!

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.750
Sublimating all substances...

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:20.190
...as well as all energy sources. A New Machine Species...

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.430
The final destiny of the universe...

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.730
...could it be total destruction?

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.400
Get up! Go forth into battle, Gai!

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:34.470
As mankind's last hope we all believe in the legend of the true hero!

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.200
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.100
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:50.160
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:54.100
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.820
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:05.100
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:10.020
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:13.940
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:16.740
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:20.500
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:25.500
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.670
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.210
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:34.340
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.300
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.380
Dividing Driver!

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:49.020
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:54.900
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.850
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:01.740
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.690
This is the final story about the King of the Braves...

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:05.830
...who fought with every last ounce of life in his body.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:09.130
Someday in the Sea of Stars

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.980
<i>Someday in the Sea of Stars</i>

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.880
Stop it!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:33.760
Mamoru!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.680
Big Sister Mikoto!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.550
My body... I can't move...

00:03:55.720 --> 00:04:00.660
If we can't execute the Program Drive then Final Fusion will be impossible.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:04.250
There's no way to run the sequence manually under these circumstances either.

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:05.420
Chief, sir...

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:10.230
It appears that the G-Stone alone somehow escaped being sublimated.

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:14.290
In a few minutes, our A.I. systems will be trashed!

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.430
So please, we beg of you!

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:19.100
While our GS-Rides are still functioning...

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:22.940
Please load our A.I. systems into the GaoMachines!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:26.850
You guys! Are you going to try running a manual Final Fusion yourselves?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:30.180
Well, you can't think of any better pilots for that job!

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:32.980
Let's make sure we go out with a bang, guys!

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:36.850
This is mankind's last-ditch attempt to survive, eh?

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:39.090
All right!

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:43.800
Load the GaoMachines with every last ounce of fuel and the GS-Rides!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.630
Load the Mobile Unit's Super-A.I. systems and prepare for launch!

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:51.760
Gutsy Galaxy Guard! Final Operation! Launch!

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.240
Roger!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.200
Set-up of the Gantry crane explosives now complete.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:25.240
The GaoMachines are now ready to go!

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:30.600
Amaterasu, trajectory for entering the Earth's atmosphere A-OK!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.210
All right! Convert!

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.950
Hey, everybody! We're counting on you!

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:40.920
We've succeeded!

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.620
All right!

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.460
Thank you, Mic!

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:50.090
Yay! I'm glad I could do something useful for you!

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:51.430
Mic?

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:53.930
Even though I was a no-good robot...

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.500
...I still got to be friends with you all. That made me happy!

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.330
Thank you...

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:02.580
No!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:06.010
Mic... the 13th...

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:12.250
We did everything we possibly could. No regrets now!

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.320
The future of all living things...

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:17.780
We're counting on you, brave heroes!

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.640
Mamoru!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.800
What in tarnation is going on out there?

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.740
Mamoru's an alien, you see!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.840
What?

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:39.310
Mamoru was sent here from another planet to defeat...

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.480
...the Zonders with his supernatural powers.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.180
All this time he's been risking his life to fight them...

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.780
...just so he could protect the rest of us!

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:50.930
So let's all give him our support! As his friends from Earth!

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:55.630
Mamoru!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.630
Hang in there, Mamoru!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.370
Hurry, get back on your feet!

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:05.740
Don't let him beat you!

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.710
Come on, Mamoru! You can do it!

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:14.280
Please don't die...

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.460
Amaterasu!

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:33.300
Stop it!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.350
It's the GaoMachines!

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:50.280
We're going to land now.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.760
Mission accomplished!

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:55.890
HyoRyu? EnRyu?

00:07:58.030 --> 00:07:58.820
Stay focused now!

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:00.660
You don't have to tell me!

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:05.590
FuRyu! RaiRyu!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.930
Special Agent Mamoru appears to be safe.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.830
All right! Bring me closer now.

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:14.000
Volfogg! Big Brother Gai!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.240
Galeon!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.480
Fusion!

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:37.160
GaiGar!

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:42.130
Cyborg Gai, guided by the G-Stone...

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:45.300
...has transformed into the battle mechanoid, GaiGar.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:49.210
Hey, hope you haven't forgotten about me!

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.040
Hurry! Final Fusion...

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.990
GaoMachines!

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:01.250
Right!

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:02.690
All right!
Roger!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.220
Right away, Captain!

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:16.440
Final Fusion!

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:29.950
Fusion process begin!

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.490
Trajectory okay!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.250
Success!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.780
Docking!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:39.830
Perfect Lock!

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:56.440
GaoGaiGar!

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.670
The ultimate King of Braves has just fused with...

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.450
...the most powerful robot brigade on Earth.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:05.010
Fight the good fight! Don't go down in defeat! Triumph over the enemy!

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:07.650
Mankind's last hope, GaoGaiGar!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.360
New Machine Species!

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:23.130
I'm taking back Mikoto!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:24.670
Bring it on!

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:28.200
Phantom Ring!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.140
Plus!

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:36.480
Broken Phantom!

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:45.620
The Phantom Ring's about to be sublimated!

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.500
My Broken Phantom has no effect!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.830
Protect Wall!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:00.840
GaoGaiGar!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.870
Hurry! Use me!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:03.500
Right!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:11.950
Not good!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.590
I'm severing the connection!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:24.160
Goldion Hammer!

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:39.310
No good, I've got to disconnect now!

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.050
Goldy!

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:49.550
No way!

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.980
How can it withstand even the Goldion Hammer?

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:58.100
Plasma Wall!

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.330
Eat this!

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.770
I can't believe how powerful that barrier is!

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:27.630
Our destiny...

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:30.670
Was our destiny somehow wrong?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.830
Is it because we waste resources?

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.500
Because we don't think twice about throwing stuff away?

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.270
Is that why you want to destroy us?

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.310
So its intention is to bring an end to this materialistic civilization?

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.850
Is this an entity who would deny our very existence?

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.210
Are you a devil? Or are you a god?

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:49.280
Could this be true purification?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.840
Our GS-Rides have reached their limit.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.550
I want to believe...

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.150
In mankind... In this world!

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.720
And in myself!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.820
So I'm going to fight!

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:03.900
For survival

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:10.400
Hell and Heaven

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.070
Your lives... just leave them in my hands!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.040
All right!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.940
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:46.370
Mamoru!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:00.950
He's weakened the barrier!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.360
Now's our chance!

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.760
Don't worry about us, just pulverize that thing!

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:27.670
Go forth with all your courage!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.490
All of our souls are now one!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.480
3 cheers for GGG!

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:03.040
Victory is within your reach!

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:45.260
Zonuda...

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:54.200
Mikoto...

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.530
Zonuda...

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.000
Gai...

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:01.540
Gai...

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:04.780
Kill me! Hurry!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:06.440
You've got to kill me!

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.240
Mikoto...

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:16.160
Please, kill me!

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:18.720
With your own hands, hurry!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:20.190
Mikoto...

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:22.260
I'm coming...

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:24.630
Wait for me.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.100
Before it's too late...

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.570
Kill me!

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:30.440
If you die...

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:32.930
...then we'll die together.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:37.840
Mikoto, I'm sorry.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:43.590
You're the most important thing in my life...

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.320
...and I couldn't protect you.

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:46.450
Gai...

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:48.380
Mikoto...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.650
I love you.

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.420
I'm so glad...

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.590
...I fell in love with you.

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.260
I'm never going to let you go now.

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:02.500
We'll be together forever and ever.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.100
Gai...

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:07.440
Please help me...

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:09.850
Mamoru.

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.190
Curatio...

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:21.880
Teneritas...

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:23.990
Sectio...

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.360
Salus...

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:29.860
Coctura...

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.390
A miracle...

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.030
...has just happened.

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.200
I...

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:10.340
Gai!

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.870
Welcome home, Mikoto.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.080
But your body!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:18.170
I guess God saved it for me...

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:21.180
...as a reward for our victory.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:22.340
Gai!

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:26.380
Mikoto! I'm never letting you go!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:27.750
Gai!

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.130
Mamoru...

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:35.260
Thank goodness!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:52.580
Kanayago?

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:55.150
Now confirming annihilation of the New Machine Species!

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:56.980
All systems have been fully restored!

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.510
Looks like Gai and the others survived!

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:02.980
There's some danger of the nearby buildings collapsing.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:04.490
That doesn't sound good!

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:08.290
All right! Multi-purpose Special Machine Ship, Kanayago, transform!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.430
Carpenters, deploy all units!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:13.830
Operation Rebuild Tokyo, start!

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:27.710
The Carpenters...

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:32.480
They are miracle tools of unprecedented proportions with the ability...

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:36.250
...to repair damage to any and all kinds of materials in an instant.

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:41.950
I owe you guys one!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.360
You have truly saved us.

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.530
I really got banged up this time.

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:48.860
Yay! I'm back to normal too, see?

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:51.300
The Pliers, so many of them!

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.380
I'm so glad...

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:55.640
They're alive, then!

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:57.400
All of you...

00:19:57.810 --> 00:19:59.010
You're alive!

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:09.860
There could be new strains of Zonders all over the universe.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:13.750
I don't have the power to defeat them.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:18.820
But I think I can help out anyone who's in trouble.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.730
Just like I tried to protect Earth.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:23.160
Mamoru...

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:24.970
Go on, then!

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:27.530
If it's a job no one can do but you, Mamoru!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.010
Don't hesitate, go forth, son!

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.510
Thank you...

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.850
Dad, Mom...

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:37.410
My little Mamoru!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.320
I'm going, then.

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.580
Come home whenever you want.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:44.820
Because this is your home, Mamoru!

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:46.190
Right...

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:47.490
Right!

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.700
I just wish I could go with you.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:58.200
I can't take you with me, Big Brother Gai. Big Sister Mikoto would kill me!

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.400
Oh, please!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.030
I don't know what to say!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.040
This power...

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:05.670
I'll be sure to use it effectively.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:09.710
I'm counting on you to protect peace on Earth.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.580
You take care of yourself, all right?

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:14.810
If you're ever in trouble, call the GGG number, okay?

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:17.750
And we'll go to the ends of the galaxy to save you!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:21.230
After all, no matter where you are, you'll always be one of our comrades!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.190
All of you...

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.290
Please take care of yourselves too!

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:27.060
Mamoru!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.460
Ta-da!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:37.500
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:42.280
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:48.460
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:47.590
Hana...

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:53.250
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:21:48.860 --> 00:21:50.160
Mamoru...

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:57.420
The journey I began that day...

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:04.350
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:11.110
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:22:11.110 --> 00:22:15.770
...let's believe in them now.

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:21.110
When you and I are grown up

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:27.800
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:44.990
Give us the wings to fly

00:22:44.990 --> 00:22:49.650
and set off into the galaxy.

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:54.990
When you and I are grown up...

00:22:54.990 --> 00:23:03.730
